### 1. 成功对比两个配置快照 (预期 200 OK，返回结构化差异)
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/1/config/snapshots/compare?sourceSnapshotId=1&targetSnapshotId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### 2. 测试缺少 sourceSnapshotId 或 targetSnapshotId 参数 (预期 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/1/config/snapshots/compare
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json



### 3. 测试非法的项目 ID (预期 400 Bad Request)
GET http://localhost:25560/api/v1/projects/0/config/snapshots/compare?sourceSnapshotId=1&targetSnapshotId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}
Content-Type: application/json